Package: xdg-desktop-portal-generic
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends},
         ${misc:Depends},
         xdg-desktop-portal,
Recommends: wayland-protocols,
Description: generic XDG Desktop Portal backend for Wayland compositors
 xdg-desktop-portal-generic implements the ScreenCast, RemoteDesktop,
 Screenshot, Clipboard, Settings, and InputCapture desktop portal
 interfaces using standard Wayland protocols (wlr and ext) rather than
 compositor-specific D-Bus APIs.
 .
 It works with any Wayland compositor that supports the standard wlr or
 ext protocols, including Sway, Hyprland, labwc, Wayfire, dwl, niri,
 COSMIC, and others, filling the same niche as xdg-desktop-portal-wlr
 but with broader protocol support (ext protocols, EIS, clipboard).
